  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">WhatsApp or Telegram. Each person picks.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Each person on the account can use WhatsApp or Telegram. There is no new app to install and no login to remember.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Whichever they use, the experience is the same: questions arrive in the chat, and they answer with text, voice notes, photos, documents or a location pin.</p>
  <p class="site-words">One team can mix the two. The Records come out the same.</p>
  <p class="site-words">It works on iPhone and Android, because it is the app already on the phone.</p>
